{"seq":2,"slug":"high-speed-signal-routing","title":"高速信号走线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/high-speed-signal-routing","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高速信号走线\">高速信号走线</h1><p>高速信号走线需要将传输线理论付诸实践。差分对的精确布线、串扰的有效抑制、回流路径的连续性以及过孔的优化设计，共同决定了信号在接收端的波形质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>差分对</strong>：两条等长、等间距、对称的走线，以边耦合或宽边耦合方式布线</li>\n<li><strong>串扰（Crosstalk）</strong>：相邻走线间电磁场耦合导致的干扰，分近端 NEXT 与远端 FEXT</li>\n<li><strong>回流路径</strong>：高频信号电流紧贴信号正下方的参考平面流动，路径中断会增大环路面积</li>\n<li><strong>过孔残桩（Stub）</strong>：通孔过孔未连接部分在特定频率谐振，恶化高速信号</li>\n<li><strong>时序预算</strong>：飞行时间差、过孔延迟、封装延迟与板内偏斜共同构成，决定等长匹配要求</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"差分对布线实践\">差分对布线实践</h2><h3 id=\"差分对耦合模式\">差分对耦合模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[差分对耦合] --&gt; B[边耦合 Edge-Coupled]&#10;    A --&gt; C[宽边耦合 Broadside-Coupled]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[同层内两线平行&lt;br&gt;最常用]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[相邻层上下对齐&lt;br&gt;节省面积]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[优点: 易于制造和检查]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[缺点: 层间对准难控制]\">graph TD\n    A[差分对耦合] --&gt; B[边耦合 Edge-Coupled]\n    A --&gt; C[宽边耦合 Broadside-Coupled]\n    B --&gt; B1[同层内两线平行&lt;br&gt;最常用]\n    C --&gt; C1[相邻层上下对齐&lt;br&gt;节省面积]\n    B --&gt; B2[优点: 易于制造和检查]\n    C --&gt; C2[缺点: 层间对准难控制]</pre><h3 id=\"差分对走线规则\">差分对走线规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等长匹配</td>\n<td>Skew ≤ 接口规格值</td>\n<td>防止差模转共模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对内间距恒定</td>\n<td>全程保持设计间距</td>\n<td>差分阻抗一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称弯折</td>\n<td>P/N 同时转弯</td>\n<td>等长且阻抗均匀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免跨分割</td>\n<td>参考平面下无缝隙</td>\n<td>回流路径完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少过孔</td>\n<td>换层次数 ≤2</td>\n<td>减少不连续点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称过孔</td>\n<td>P/N 使用相同结构过孔</td>\n<td>避免 Skew</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"等长补偿技术\">等长补偿技术</h3><p>当差分对两线长度不等时，需在较短线添加蛇形补偿（Meander）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蛇形幅度</td>\n<td>≤3× 线宽</td>\n<td>过大影响阻抗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛇形间距</td>\n<td>≥4× 线宽</td>\n<td>避免自耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补偿位置</td>\n<td>靠近不等长源头</td>\n<td>局部补偿优于集中补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等长精度</td>\n<td>±1–5mil (视接口)</td>\n<td>参照接口标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"串扰分析与控制\">串扰分析与控制</h2><h3 id=\"串扰形成机制\">串扰形成机制</h3><p>串扰是相邻走线间电磁场耦合导致的干扰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>串扰类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>极性</th>\n<th>影响位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>近端串扰(NEXT)</td>\n<td>容性+感性耦合叠加</td>\n<td>同极性</td>\n<td>驱动端侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远端串扰(FEXT)</td>\n<td>容性-感性耦合差值</td>\n<td>带状线近零</td>\n<td>接收端侧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"串扰抑制措施\">串扰抑制措施</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>措施</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3W 规则</td>\n<td>降低 20–25dB</td>\n<td>走线间距 ≥3× 线宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保护线(Guard Trace)</td>\n<td>降低 15–20dB</td>\n<td>信号间铺地走线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交走线</td>\n<td>大幅降低</td>\n<td>相邻层走线方向垂直</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩短平行段</td>\n<td>成比例降低</td>\n<td>限制平行耦合长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增大层间距</td>\n<td>降低宽边耦合</td>\n<td>非相邻层走高速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增加屏蔽层</td>\n<td>接近消除</td>\n<td>信号层间加 GND 层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"串扰预算\">串扰预算</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[系统噪声预算] --&gt; B[串扰分配&lt;br&gt;通常 30-50%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[反射噪声&lt;br&gt;20-30%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[电源噪声&lt;br&gt;20-30%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[裕量&lt;br&gt;10-20%]&#10;    B --&gt; F[NEXT + FEXT &lt; 分配值]&#10;    F --&gt; G[转化为间距/平行长度约束]\">graph LR\n    A[系统噪声预算] --&gt; B[串扰分配&lt;br&gt;通常 30-50%]\n    A --&gt; C[反射噪声&lt;br&gt;20-30%]\n    A --&gt; D[电源噪声&lt;br&gt;20-30%]\n    A --&gt; E[裕量&lt;br&gt;10-20%]\n    B --&gt; F[NEXT + FEXT &lt; 分配值]\n    F --&gt; G[转化为间距/平行长度约束]</pre><h2 id=\"回流路径设计\">回流路径设计</h2><h3 id=\"回流路径的重要性\">回流路径的重要性</h3><p>高频信号的电流回流紧贴信号正下方的参考平面流动（趋肤效应）。回流路径的任何中断都会增大环路面积，产生 EMI 辐射。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参考平面开槽</td>\n<td>回流绕行，环路增大</td>\n<td>避免在信号下方分割</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换层参考变化</td>\n<td>回流中断</td>\n<td>在过孔旁加回流过孔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无参考平面区域</td>\n<td>阻抗不可控</td>\n<td>确保信号层紧邻参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地平面过孔过多</td>\n<td>平面碎片化</td>\n<td>合理规划过孔区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"换层回流处理\">换层回流处理</h3><p>当信号从 L1（参考 L2-GND）切换到 L6（参考 L5-GND）时：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>信号过孔换层</td>\n<td>从 L1 到 L6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>旁加 GND 过孔(L2→L5)</td>\n<td>提供回流路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>过孔间距 ≤50mil</td>\n<td>减小回流环路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>如参考为不同电源，加去耦电容</td>\n<td>桥接不同参考平面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"过孔优化\">过孔优化</h2><h3 id=\"过孔残桩效应\">过孔残桩效应</h3><p>通孔过孔穿透所有层，未连接部分形成残桩（Stub），在特定频率产生谐振：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{resonance} = \\frac{c}{4 \\times L_{stub} \\times \\sqrt{\\varepsilon_r}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1083em;vertical-align:-1.0007em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0007em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如：60mil 残桩在约 10GHz 处产生谐振，严重恶化 10Gbps+ 信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"残桩消除方法\">残桩消除方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>背钻(Back-drill)</td>\n<td>物理去除残桩</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>5–25GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盲孔(Blind Via)</td>\n<td>不穿透全部层</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>5–50GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微孔(Microvia)</td>\n<td>激光钻，无残桩</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>&gt;10GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短残桩叠层</td>\n<td>优化信号层位置</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>&lt;10GHz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"差分对过孔设计\">差分对过孔设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过孔间距</td>\n<td>等于差分对间距</td>\n<td>保持耦合一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地过孔数量</td>\n<td>4个(四角)</td>\n<td>完善回流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地过孔间距</td>\n<td>围绕信号过孔 50mil 内</td>\n<td>减小环路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反焊盘(Antipad)</td>\n<td>比钻孔大 8–10mil 每侧</td>\n<td>避免短路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时序与长度匹配\">时序与长度匹配</h2><h3 id=\"总线内等长\">总线内等长</h3><p>并行总线（如 DDR 数据总线）需要组内等长：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>总线类型</th>\n<th>等长要求</th>\n<th>参考信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DDR5 DQ 组</td>\n<td>±5mil</td>\n<td>对应 DQS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDR5 地址/命令</td>\n<td>±10mil</td>\n<td>CLK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCIe Lane</td>\n<td>±5mil</td>\n<td>差分对内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGMII</td>\n<td>±50mil</td>\n<td>TX_CLK / RX_CLK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时序预算分析\">时序预算分析</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时序分量</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>飞行时间差</td>\n<td>走线长度差</td>\n<td>6.7ps/mm(FR4)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过孔延迟</td>\n<td>过孔电感</td>\n<td>10–30ps/个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封装延迟</td>\n<td>IC 内部走线</td>\n<td>50–200ps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>板内偏斜</td>\n<td>匹配精度</td>\n<td>±5–50ps</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高速信号走线是信号完整性工程的核心实践。差分对的精确控制、串扰的有效管理、回流路径的连续性保证，以及过孔的精心优化，共同构成了高速 PCB 设计的技术体系。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>差分对布线以等长、等间距、对称换层为铁律，等长补偿靠近不等长源头</li>\n<li>串扰控制手段包括 3W 规则、保护线、正交走线与增大层间距</li>\n<li>回流路径必须连续，换层时在过孔旁就近放置回流过孔</li>\n<li>过孔残桩通过背钻、盲孔或微孔消除，以支撑高速信号</li>\n<li>并行总线按接口要求在组内等长，并以时序预算校核裕量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高速信号走线","id":"高速信号走线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"差分对布线实践","id":"差分对布线实践"},{"level":3,"text":"差分对耦合模式","id":"差分对耦合模式"},{"level":3,"text":"差分对走线规则","id":"差分对走线规则"},{"level":3,"text":"等长补偿技术","id":"等长补偿技术"},{"level":2,"text":"串扰分析与控制","id":"串扰分析与控制"},{"level":3,"text":"串扰形成机制","id":"串扰形成机制"},{"level":3,"text":"串扰抑制措施","id":"串扰抑制措施"},{"level":3,"text":"串扰预算","id":"串扰预算"},{"level":2,"text":"回流路径设计","id":"回流路径设计"},{"level":3,"text":"回流路径的重要性","id":"回流路径的重要性"},{"level":3,"text":"换层回流处理","id":"换层回流处理"},{"level":2,"text":"过孔优化","id":"过孔优化"},{"level":3,"text":"过孔残桩效应","id":"过孔残桩效应"},{"level":3,"text":"残桩消除方法","id":"残桩消除方法"},{"level":3,"text":"差分对过孔设计","id":"差分对过孔设计"},{"level":2,"text":"时序与长度匹配","id":"时序与长度匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"总线内等长","id":"总线内等长"},{"level":3,"text":"时序预算分析","id":"时序预算分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"阻抗控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/impedance-control"},"next":{"title":"电源完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/power-integrity"}}